# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:4
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_firsttime_c9cb3665:

    # "Upon entering, a busty blonde woman carrying two ales smiled as she placed them on the table."
    "들어서자, 에일 두 잔을 들고 있는 가슴 큰 금발 여성이 테이블에 잔을 내려놓으며 미소 지었다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:6
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_firsttime_948931ac:

    # BETTY @ happy "Welcome, lovelies!"
    BETTY @ happy "어서 오세요, 사랑스러운 분들!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:7
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_firsttime_9b14a2e7:

    # BETTY @ happy "Welcome to {i}The Naughty Wench.{/i} I trusted your travels had been long and hard?"
    BETTY @ happy "{i}버릇없는 계집{/i}에 온 걸 환영해. 여행은 길고 힘들었다고 믿어도 되지?"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:8
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_firsttime_7ec72926:

    # "She smiled and winked."
    "그녀는 미소 지으며 윙크했다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:9
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_firsttime_09ce13ff:

    # BETTY @ blush "My name's Betty. Come, come take a seat. Let me and ma' husband fetch you somethin'!"
    BETTY @ blush "내 이름은 베티야. 어서, 어서 앉아. 나랑 우리 남편이 뭐 좀 가져다줄게!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:10
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_firsttime_23e50e3a:

    # BRYHER @ talk "Don't forget to offer 'em a room!"
    BRYHER @ talk "방도 권하는 거 잊지 마!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:11
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_firsttime_f7b6d33a:

    # BETTY @ angry "I WAS ABOUT TO, DEAR!"
    BETTY @ angry "나도 하려던 참이었어, 여보!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:12
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_firsttime_bd9264fe:

    # BETTY @ happy "Never mind me husband, Bryher. Just let me or my husband know if you wanted anything."
    BETTY @ happy "우리 남편, 브라이어는 신경 쓰지 마. 뭐 필요한 거 있으면 나나 내 남편한테 말해줘."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:13
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_firsttime_93ca9d76:

    # BETTY @ happy "What could I do for you, love?"
    BETTY @ happy "뭘 해드릴까, 자기야?"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:18
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_93ca9d76:

    # BETTY @ happy "What could I do for you, love?"
    BETTY @ happy "뭘 해드릴까, 자기야?"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:21
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_d815ccad:

    # BETTY @ happy "Sure! What would you like?"
    BETTY @ happy "그럼! 뭐 드릴까요?"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:25
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_647dc34f:

    # BETTY @ happy "Coming right up!"
    BETTY @ happy "바로 가져올게!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:26
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_00051c52:

    # "Betty hurried to the bar before returning with a jug of ale topped with a thick white froth."
    "베티는 서둘러 바 카운터로 가더니 두꺼운 하얀 거품이 올라앉은 에일 한 주전자를 들고 돌아왔다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:27
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_8393a1b4:

    # BETTY @ happy "Hope that quenched your thirst!"
    BETTY @ happy "그걸로 갈증이 풀렸길 바라!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:29
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_a7a48e09:

    # "Upon sipping the drink, I sighed, already feeling remarkably better."
    "음료를 한 모금 마시자, 나는 벌써 눈에 띄게 기분이 나아지며 한숨을 내쉬었다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:32
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_05d5682b:

    # BETTY @ happy "We've got just the thing for you!"
    BETTY @ happy "딱 맞는 걸 준비해 놨어!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:33
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_6b4439b9:

    # BETTY @ happy "Roasted boar and onion!"
    BETTY @ happy "멧돼지 구이에 양파!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:36
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_6f8a3b32:

    # "Betty sauntered off and returned about thirty minutes later with my steaming meal."
    "베티는 느긋하게 걸어가더니 삼십 분쯤 후에 김이 모락모락 나는 요리를 들고 돌아왔다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:41
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_2b565401:

    # BETTY @ blush "Enjoy, darling!"
    BETTY @ blush "맛있게 먹어, 여보!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:42
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_59ce854f:

    # "She wandered off to another table."
    "그녀는 다른 테이블로 걸어갔다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:44
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_2086012a:

    # BETTY @ talk "Call me over when you wanted to order something, love."
    BETTY @ talk "뭐 주문하고 싶으면 불러요, 자기."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:48
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_f70993bb:

    # BETTY @ happy "Rumors?"
    BETTY @ happy "소문?"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:51
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_55377041:

    # BETTY @ talk "Rumor had it strange things were happening on the Orasmore Isles."
    BETTY @ talk "소문에 오라스모어 섬에서 이상한 일들이 벌어지고 있다더군."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:52
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_213b3383:

    # BETTY @ shock "People were saying the lands were cursed!"
    BETTY @ shock "사람들이 그 땅은 저주받았다고 하더라고!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:54
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_5c72945c:

    # BETTY @ talk "There'd been talk of some scaly monster going toe to toe with Zanarak on the city walls!"
    BETTY @ talk "도시 성벽에서 비늘 달린 괴물이 자나락과 맞붙었다는 얘기가 돌더라고!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:55
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_fca984d2:

    # BETTY @ think "Sounded to me like a bunch of drunkards imagining things."
    BETTY @ think "내가 듣기론 술 취한 놈들이 상상이나 부풀린 얘기 같은데."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:57
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_e448cdbd:

    # BETTY @ talk "They said the GTC and the merchant lords' trade war was getting more and more volatile by the day."
    BETTY @ talk "GTC와 상인 군주들 간의 무역 전쟁이 하루가 다르게 점점 더 격화되고 있다더군."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:58
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_0b590f9e:

    # BETTY @ angry "Greedy bastards... How much coin did they bloody need?"
    BETTY @ angry "욕심 많은 개자식들... 도대체 돈을 얼마나 더 처먹어야 하는 거야?"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:60
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_a1909d49:

    # BETTY @ sad "Rumor had it there were orcs hiding up north in Angmurus."
    BETTY @ sad "소문에 앙그무루스 북쪽에 오크들이 숨어 있다더군."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:61
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_97d33d73:

    # BETTY @ scared "Didn't know what was scarier... them or the Demorai."
    BETTY @ scared "뭐가 더 무서운지 모르겠네... 그 녀석들인지 데모라이인지."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:63
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_4999deb8:

    # VES @ talk "..."
    VES @ talk "..."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:64
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_06e9eb33:

    # BETTY @ scared "FUCKING HELLS!"
    BETTY @ scared "씨발 젠장!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:65
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_452c57c5:

    # VES @ angry "I am not scary!"
    VES @ angry "난 무섭지 않아!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:66
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_31ed195e:

    # VES @ angry "I am very lovable!"
    VES @ angry "난 아주 사랑스럽다고!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:67
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_86b6049b:

    # BETTY @ talk "W-Whatever you say, uhh... love."
    BETTY @ talk "뭐-뭐라든지, 어... 자기야."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:68
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_287ae85c:

    # BETTY @ talk "I guessed adventuring parties were a lot more open now than when I lived in the capital!"
    BETTY @ talk "모험가 파티들이 내가 수도에 살 때보다 훨씬 개방적이구나 싶었어!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:72
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_8c6c1bf2:

    # BETTY @ talk "Loved his milk and playing with my tits."
    BETTY @ talk "그의 우유를 좋아하고 내 가슴을 만지작거리는 걸 좋아해."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:73
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_47750900:

    # "Betty's eyes fluttered as she looked at me alluringly."
    "베티가 매혹적인 눈빛으로 나를 바라보며 눈을 깜빡였다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:74
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_b0f586b2:

    # BETTY @ lust "{i}Reminded me of his father...{/i}"
    BETTY @ lust "{i}그의 아버지를 생각나게 하네...{/i}"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:78
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_bd1aafcf:

    # "Betty blinked at the request before a small, alluring smile appeared on her lips."
    "베티는 그 요청에 눈을 깜빡이더니 입가에 작고 매혹적인 미소를 띄웠다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:79
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_4be4d1f8:

    # "She inched closer, speaking in a hushed tone while glancing back at her husband. He looked at her and nodded."
    "그녀는 조금 더 다가와, 남편을 힐끗 뒤돌아보며 낮은 목소리로 말했다. 남편은 그녀를 보고 고개를 끄덕였다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:80
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_889e55e6:

    # BETTY @ blush "Well, sir... We did provide an evening {i}nightcap and some... companionship.{/i}"
    BETTY @ blush "뭐, 손님... 저희가 저녁에 {i}마지막 한잔과 약간의... 동침을{/i} 제공하긴 합니다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:81
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_e498ca4b:

    # BETTY @ blush "{i}For an extra fee.{/i}"
    BETTY @ blush "{i}추가 요금이 붙습니다.{/i}"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:82
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_2cbe33d8:

    # "Her hands carefully brushed against me."
    "그녀의 손이 조심스럽게 나를 스쳤다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:83
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_04aaa7a6:

    # BETTY @ talk "You'd have to get a room here... But was that something you'd like?"
    BETTY @ talk "여기 방을 잡아야 할 텐데... 그래도 원하는 거야?"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:86
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_5310394d:

    # BETTY @ happy "Then I'd make arrangements to swing by your room this evening."
    BETTY @ happy "그럼 오늘 저녁에 손님 방에 들를 수 있도록 준비할게요."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:89
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_db8a3077:

    # "Betty pulled away."
    "베티가 몸을 뗐다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:90
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_7bcf2743:

    # BETTY @ talk "Well, if you changed your mind."
    BETTY @ talk "음, 마음 바뀌면 말해."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:91
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_3eb1096c:

    # BETTY @ talk "You knew where to find me."
    BETTY @ talk "어디서 날 찾을지 알잖아."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:94
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_talk_menu_59410aa2:

    # BETTY @ happy "Safe travels!"
    BETTY @ happy "안전한 여행 되길!"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:100
translate kr fortress_inn_bryher_talk_42230859:

    # BRYHER "Interested in drinks or food? Speak to the wife."
    BRYHER "술이나 음식에 관심 있으면 마누라한테 말해."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:101
translate kr fortress_inn_bryher_talk_645dd035:

    # BRYHER "If you wanted a room, let me know."
    BRYHER "방 필요하면 말해줘."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:104
translate kr fortress_inn_bryher_talk_menu_cd369c53:

    # BRYHER @ talk "One hundred and fifty coins."
    BRYHER @ talk "백오십 코인."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:109
translate kr fortress_inn_bryher_talk_menu_5c1b0af8:

    # "He handed me a small iron key."
    "그는 나에게 작은 철제 열쇠를 건넸다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:110
translate kr fortress_inn_bryher_talk_menu_ab84ff82:

    # BRYHER @ talk "Rooms were upstairs on the far left."
    BRYHER @ talk "방은 위층 맨 왼쪽에 있어."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:113
translate kr fortress_inn_bryher_talk_menu_664821a1:

    # "The man turned away and resumed cleaning the cups."
    "남자는 돌아서서 다시 잔을 닦기 시작했다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:116
translate kr fortress_inn_bryher_talk_menu_32d3be08:

    # BRYHER @ talk "Then why were you wasting my time?"
    BRYHER @ talk "그럼 왜 내 시간을 낭비한 거야?"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:123
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_night_73c537d4:

    # "... Later that night."
    "... 그날 밤 늦게."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:130
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_night_4f27fe25:

    # BETTY @ happy "Sorry I'm late. Had to wait till all the other guests were asleep."
    BETTY @ happy "늦어서 미안. 다른 손님들 다 잘 때까지 기다려야 했어."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:131
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_night_171efa64:

    # "Betty's eyes wandered over my body."
    "베티의 시선이 내 몸을 훑었다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:132
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_night_80c06ae1:

    # BETTY @ blush "Fucking hells, looks like I got lucky tonight."
    BETTY @ blush "씨발 젠장, 오늘밤 운 좋은가 보네."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:133
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_night_d6e9e69f:

    # BETTY @ blush "You're a lot tastier looking than the usual fucks who want this."
    BETTY @ blush "이걸 원하는 평범한 씹을 놈들보다 훨씬 더 먹음직스러워 보이네."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:134
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_night_a728239a:

    # MC @ think "Is your husband asleep?"
    MC @ think "네 남편은 잠들었나?"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:135
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_night_ad105034:

    # BETTY @ happy "Don't worry about him, love. He knows we've gotta make coin where we can."
    BETTY @ happy "그 사람 걱정 마, 자기야. 돈 벌 수 있는 데서 벌어야 하는 거 알아."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:136
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_night_a3b295a2:

    # BETTY @ happy "He won't bother us tonight."
    BETTY @ happy "오늘 밤은 방해 안 할 거야."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:137
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_night_94cb51dc:

    # MC @ think "How much?"
    MC @ think "얼마지?"

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:138
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_night_c41a579d:

    # BETTY @ happy "Two hundred for my mouth. Three-fifty for my womanhood..."
    BETTY @ happy "입으로 이백. 내 여성성은 삼백오십..."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:139
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_night_25e85aed:

    # "She paused."
    "그녀가 잠시 멈췄다."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:140
translate kr fortress_inn_betty_night_71b581d9:

    # BETTY "Five hundred for me arse, because I hate not being able to walk properly in the morning."
    BETTY "내 엉덩이는 오백, 아침에 제대로 못 걷는 게 싫어서 말이야."

# game/data/travel_events/fortress_inn/fortress_inn_1_betty_wench.rpy:147
